# Allow-list: ignore everything by default, then re-add only the build inputs.
# Keeps secrets (.env), local DBs (*.db), review artifacts, tests/, scripts/,
# and any future local junk out of the Docker build context / layer cache.
# `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile therefore can never leak them into a layer.
*
!rust-toolchain.toml
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!crates/**
!src
!src/**
!examples
examples/*
!examples/config.docker.yaml
